---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const breadcrumbs = [{ href: '/en/', name: 'Home' }, { href: '/about/', name: 'About' }];
---
<BaseLayout title="About MyZooTwin: The 3D Zoo Game and Animal Journal" description="MyZooTwin is an independent browser zoo game and animal journal. Learn how we separate simulated animal care from wildlife facts and source our stories." {breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
    <h1>About MyZooTwin</h1>
    <p>MyZooTwin is an independent educational and editorial project. We make a browser game about caring for a virtual zoo, and publish stories that help you look more closely at the animals that inspired it.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="about-grid">
    <div><h2>How we make our stories</h2><p>Our animal stories separate scenes from the game from facts about life in the wild. The animal facts link to references such as the San Diego Zoo Wildlife Alliance and Smithsonian’s National Zoo. Generated illustrations are labelled in their captions. The tutorial uses gameplay screenshots.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Where to start</h2><p><a href="/en/tutorial/">Follow the illustrated tutorial</a> to build your first aviary, <a href="/animals/">meet the five animals</a> in the library, or <a href="/learn/">learn what the simulation can show you</a>.</p><p>The game runs without an account and saves progress in the browser. Its scores and rules are models, not animal-care instructions.</p></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .page-intro{padding:clamp(3rem,9vw,7rem) clamp(1.2rem,10vw,10rem);background:var(--cream)}.page-intro h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,5.5rem);margin:1rem 0}.page-intro>p:last-child{font-size:1.2rem;max-width:59ch;color:var(--muted)}.about-grid{max-width:1100px;padding:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,6rem) clamp(1.2rem,5vw,5rem);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem}.about-grid h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem)}.about-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.about-grid a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}@media(max-width:650px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}}
</style>